---------------\n\nVersion 1.0\n\nCreated as a simple reference workflow for users getting started with NoobAI.\n\nNAI has a good selection of Loras. Experiment with them and you may get some pleasantly surprising results. There are many variants and mixes of this model. Pick the ones that suits your taste and experiment with it.\n\nPurpose\n\n✓ Educational\n✓ Minimal\n✓ Easy to extend\n\nVerified\n\n✓ Text-to-Image\n\nVerified Settings\n\n✓ CFG : 4.0 to 7.0\n✓ Sampler : Euler / Euler A / DPM++ 2M\n✓ Scheduler : Simple / Beta / Karras\n\nThese settings were used to validate this workflow and are recommended as the baseline configuration.\n\nVerified Resolution :\n✓ UHD (1088 x 1920)\n\n(Observation: Results looked good in lower as well as higher resolutions)\n\nVerified Hardware\n\nGPU : RTX 2080 (8 GB VRAM)\nRAM : 64 GB\nComfyUI : 0.27.x\n\nFuture Variants\n\n□ Image-to-Image\n□ High Resolution\n□ Detail Enhancement\n"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":5,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[3485.629699223832,327.1722249070538],"size":[732.3529411764703,176.47058823529414],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":34},{"localized_name":"text","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CONDITIONING","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[3]}],"title":"Negative","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0","Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["lowres, bad quality, sketch, worst quality, low quality, bad anatomy, bad hands, 4koma, comic, greyscale, censored, jpeg artifacts, 3d, score_6, score_5, score_4, ugly face, low res, interlocked fingers, anatomically incorrect hands, bad anatomy, pony, furry, (censored,realistic,3D:1.3),"]},{"id":14,"type":"NdSuperLoraLoader","pos":[2906.1591109885585,593.3486954952916],"size":[639.470588235